NAME
       diff - compare two files line by line

SYNOPSIS
       diff [-q] file1 file2

DESCRIPTION
       Reports the lines that differ between FILE1 and FILE2.

OPTIONS
       -q     report only whether the files differ, without the detail

EXIT STATUS
       0 if the files are identical, 1 if they differ.

SEE ALSO
       cmp via diff -q, grep(1)
